# IDE & Editor Configurations
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# Flutter & Dart Build Output (Recursive for all subprojects)
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/.packages
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/coverage/
