# Native Desktop Ephemeral & Generated Files
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/

# App Symbols & Maps
*.symbols
*.map.json

# Local Runtime Workspace / User Data (e.g., local storage tests)
**/.local/
**/workspace.json
**/workspace_storage/

# Crash dumps & core dumps
core
core.*
vgcore.*
